[
  {
    "text": "Nineteen scalp electrodes.",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.4,
    "seg": 0
  },
  {
    "text": "What's on the next page?",
    "start": 3.68,
    "end": 5.06,
    "seg": 0
  },
  {
    "text": "The University of Alaska Anchorage",
    "start": 7.08,
    "end": 9.65,
    "seg": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "has a new dry E E",
    "start": 9.68,
    "end": 12.143,
    "seg": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "G.",
    "start": 12.173,
    "end": 12.873,
    "seg": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "The university announced it for",
    "start": 13.72,
    "end": 16.169999999999998,
    "seg": 2
  },
  {
    "text": "its A I and Robotics Lab",
    "start": 16.2,
    "end": 18.369999999999997,
    "seg": 2
  },
  {
    "text": "on September ninth.",
    "start": 18.4,
    "end": 20.4,
    "seg": 2
  },
  {
    "text": "The Educational Legacy Fund funded",
    "start": 21.4,
    "end": 24.009999999999998,
    "seg": 3
  },
  {
    "text": "it.",
    "start": 24.04,
    "end": 24.74,
    "seg": 3
  },
  {
    "text": "Students and faculty have trained.",
    "start": 25.26,
    "end": 27.52,
    "seg": 3
  },
  {
    "text": "The device records electrical activity",
    "start": 28.68,
    "end": 31.95,
    "seg": 4
  },
  {
    "text": "using sensors that rest directly",
    "start": 31.98,
    "end": 34.23,
    "seg": 4
  },
  {
    "text": "against the scalp.",
    "start": 34.26,
    "end": 35.54,
    "seg": 4
  },
  {
    "text": "Graduate student Vadim Egorov has",
    "start": 36.64,
    "end": 39.83,
    "seg": 5
  },
  {
    "text": "watched his own signals appear.",
    "start": 39.86,
    "end": 41.76,
    "seg": 5
  },
  {
    "text": "He usually works with public E",
    "start": 42.88,
    "end": 45.18,
    "seg": 6
  },
  {
    "text": "E G datasets.",
    "start": 45.21,
    "end": 46.2,
    "seg": 6
  },
  {
    "text": "Now he's looking forward to collecting",
    "start": 47.08,
    "end": 49.629999999999995,
    "seg": 7
  },
  {
    "text": "recordings for his own tasks.",
    "start": 49.66,
    "end": 51.76,
    "seg": 7
  },
  {
    "text": "Who might a future answer work",
    "start": 52.8,
    "end": 55.07,
    "seg": 8
  },
  {
    "text": "for?",
    "start": 55.1,
    "end": 55.800000000000004,
    "seg": 8
  },
  {
    "text": "U A A plans to study",
    "start": 56.78,
    "end": 58.91,
    "seg": 9
  },
  {
    "text": "cognitive states during reading.",
    "start": 58.94,
    "end": 60.9,
    "seg": 9
  },
  {
    "text": "Another planned project pairs brain",
    "start": 61.84,
    "end": 64.55,
    "seg": 10
  },
  {
    "text": "activity with eye movements during",
    "start": 64.58,
    "end": 67.17,
    "seg": 10
  },
  {
    "text": "programming.",
    "start": 67.2,
    "end": 67.9,
    "seg": 10
  },
  {
    "text": "Those are plans, with the answers",
    "start": 69.26,
    "end": 71.81,
    "seg": 11
  },
  {
    "text": "still ahead.",
    "start": 71.84,
    "end": 72.76,
    "seg": 11
  },
  {
    "text": "And the public recordings?",
    "start": 73.8,
    "end": 75.26,
    "seg": 12
  },
  {
    "text": "They keep their place.",
    "start": 75.74,
    "end": 77.12,
    "seg": 12
  },
  {
    "text": "Researchers can check whether existing",
    "start": 78.46,
    "end": 80.78999999999999,
    "seg": 13
  },
  {
    "text": "recordings fit the question.",
    "start": 80.82,
    "end": 82.39,
    "seg": 13
  },
  {
    "text": "If they do, useful analysis can",
    "start": 82.42,
    "end": 85.97,
    "seg": 13
  },
  {
    "text": "start there.",
    "start": 86.0,
    "end": 86.7,
    "seg": 13
  },
  {
    "text": "They can also plan a new",
    "start": 88.1,
    "end": 89.63,
    "seg": 14
  },
  {
    "text": "recording around another task.",
    "start": 89.66,
    "end": 91.72,
    "seg": 14
  },
  {
    "text": "The extra page holds a plan",
    "start": 93.14,
    "end": 94.87,
    "seg": 15
  },
  {
    "text": "that students can help design.",
    "start": 94.9,
    "end": 96.44,
    "seg": 15
  },
  {
    "text": "The old pages stay open beside",
    "start": 97.46,
    "end": 99.69,
    "seg": 15
  },
  {
    "text": "it.",
    "start": 99.72,
    "end": 100.42,
    "seg": 15
  },
  {
    "text": "A recording alone doesn't supply",
    "start": 101.66,
    "end": 103.99,
    "seg": 16
  },
  {
    "text": "an interpretation.",
    "start": 104.02,
    "end": 104.78,
    "seg": 16
  },
  {
    "text": "If a future model claims to",
    "start": 106.1,
    "end": 108.05,
    "seg": 17
  },
  {
    "text": "work for new people, test it",
    "start": 108.08,
    "end": 110.49,
    "seg": 17
  },
  {
    "text": "on people absent from training.",
    "start": 110.52,
    "end": 112.14,
    "seg": 17
  },
  {
    "text": "That's a research principle, not",
    "start": 113.1,
    "end": 115.83,
    "seg": 18
  },
  {
    "text": "a reported U A A result.",
    "start": 115.86,
    "end": 117.44,
    "seg": 18
  },
  {
    "text": "Which question about learning should",
    "start": 118.94,
    "end": 121.19,
    "seg": 19
  },
  {
    "text": "they investigate first?",
    "start": 121.22,
    "end": 122.28,
    "seg": 19
  }
]